// Recording layout: no tab bar, no status bar.
//
// The stock `default` layout stacks a tab-bar above and a status-bar below the
// viewport. In a recording that costs two rows to chrome the demo never refers
// to, and - because the tape records a Zellij running inside another Zellij -
// the frame ends up with two near-identical status bars at the bottom.
//
// Used by every session the tour creates, including the ones it hops into, so
// the frame looks the same before and after the jump.
layout {
    pane
}
